{
  "$schema": "https://example.com/nextrea-design-tokens",
  "project": "nextrea",
  "description": "nextrea 设计 token 单一事实来源。color 值为 RGBA 0-1 数组(Kanzi 颜色约定)或 #RRGGBBAA 字符串;在 core 的 Resource Dictionary 中按 Theme_Day / Theme_Night 填入对应取值。",
  "themes": {
    "Day": {
      "Color/Background": "#F5F6F8FF",
      "Color/Surface": "#FFFFFFFF",
      "Color/Accent": "#1E6BFFFF",
      "Color/TextPrimary": "#1A1D21FF",
      "Color/TextSecondary": "#5A626BFF",
      "Color/Divider": "#E2E5EAFF",
      "Color/Success": "#1Fae6cFF",
      "Color/Warning": "#E8A317FF",
      "Color/Error": "#E5484DFF"
    },
    "Night": {
      "Color/Background": "#0E1116FF",
      "Color/Surface": "#1A1F26FF",
      "Color/Accent": "#4D8BFFFF",
      "Color/TextPrimary": "#F2F4F7FF",
      "Color/TextSecondary": "#A2ABB5FF",
      "Color/Divider": "#2A313AFF",
      "Color/Success": "#3DDC97FF",
      "Color/Warning": "#FFC453FF",
      "Color/Error": "#FF6B70FF"
    }
  },
  "base": {
    "Font/Title": { "family": "font_cjk", "size": 32, "weight": "Bold" },
    "Font/Body": { "family": "font_cjk", "size": 22, "weight": "Regular" },
    "Font/Caption": { "family": "font_cjk", "size": 16, "weight": "Regular" },
    "Size/RadiusS": 6,
    "Size/RadiusM": 12,
    "Size/RadiusL": 24,
    "Size/SpacingS": 8,
    "Size/SpacingM": 16,
    "Size/SpacingL": 32,
    "Motion/DurationFast": 0.15,
    "Motion/DurationNormal": 0.3
  },
  "notes": [
    "颜色为示意基线,最终取值以 UX 视觉规范为准。",
    "Day/Night 必须各自包含全部 Color 键;Font/Size/Motion 与主题无关,放在 base。",
    "新增 token 只允许追加,不得修改/删除已交付键名。"
  ]
}
